		{"id":"9062de896fa361b4","type":"text","text":"# DSL\n(абонентская цифровая ли-\nния)\nDigital Subscriber Line\n\nThe phone line provider company also provide the internet, so the internet connection pass through the existant phone lines","x":-14,"y":-216,"width":250,"height":297},
